{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sanity Loops</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sanity Loops</strong> puts you in the shoes of a student trying to find his place in a world full of strange occurrences and <strong>unexpected</strong> twists. What begins as a simple search for a job to earn money for a gift for Stacey quickly escalates into a deeper journey, challenging your perception of reality. As you take on a job at a local <strong>kiosk</strong>, you begin to experience increasingly bizarre and unsettling events that make you question <strong>what is real</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You got ability to <strong>receive messages from NPCs</strong> via chat<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629360/extras/0bbe821acc65a31dd90aa0c811004ea2.poster.avif?t=1774169391\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629360/extras/0bbe821acc65a31dd90aa0c811004ea2.webm?t=1774169391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629360/extras/0bbe821acc65a31dd90aa0c811004ea2.mp4?t=1774169391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive dialog system with ability to <strong>make choices</strong>. Every choice got his own <strong>affect</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629360/extras/2a467a286669734c50d60993ef2ab826.poster.avif?t=1774169391\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629360/extras/2a467a286669734c50d60993ef2ab826.webm?t=17